{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unko Technica&quot; is an unapologetic, high-difficulty 2D action game that challenges you to guide an automatically-moving &quot;Unko&quot; to its goal\u2014the toilet\u2014across a neon-lit, dazzling world.(Unko means &quot;poop&quot; in Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the comical facade, this game demands flawless timing and razor-sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To all fans of hardcore action: We deliver the ultimate test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.poster.avif?t=1761641711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.webm?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.mp4?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There are no emotionally moving scenarios in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no elements such as attractive characters.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Poop to the Toilet Bowl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Depth </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in the game is &quot;Jump.&quot;That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this single action is all you have to navigate over 150 diverse and unforgiving stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true test of mettle awaits, where repeated failure and trial-and-error are the only path to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Uniquely Challenging Stages </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, spike walls, ON/OFF switches... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of unique and devious gimmicks will appear as you advance, escalating the difficulty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcoming these different traps requires quick reflexes and genuine puzzle-solving skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Pulse-Pounding Sound </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and an addictive, cool BGM intensify the gameplay, completing the signature &quot;Stylish Poop Action&quot; aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.poster.avif?t=1761641711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.webm?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.mp4?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Spin, and Customize Your Own Poop! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the &quot;UN-COINs&quot; you collect in stages to spin a Gacha for customization items for your Unko, or to unlock even more challenging bonus stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with tons of unique items to collect\u2014prove your mastery by collecting them all!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3101010?t=1761641711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3101010?t=1761641711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761641711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761641711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4004190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unko Technica&quot; is an unapologetic, high-difficulty 2D action game that challenges you to guide an automatically-moving &quot;Unko&quot; to its goal\u2014the toilet\u2014across a neon-lit, dazzling world.(Unko means &quot;poop&quot; in Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the comical facade, this game demands flawless timing and razor-sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To all fans of hardcore action: We deliver the ultimate test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.poster.avif?t=1761641711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.webm?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.mp4?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There are no emotionally moving scenarios in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no elements such as attractive characters.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Poop to the Toilet Bowl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Depth </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in the game is &quot;Jump.&quot;That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this single action is all you have to navigate over 150 diverse and unforgiving stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true test of mettle awaits, where repeated failure and trial-and-error are the only path to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Uniquely Challenging Stages </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, spike walls, ON/OFF switches... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of unique and devious gimmicks will appear as you advance, escalating the difficulty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcoming these different traps requires quick reflexes and genuine puzzle-solving skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Pulse-Pounding Sound </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and an addictive, cool BGM intensify the gameplay, completing the signature &quot;Stylish Poop Action&quot; aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.poster.avif?t=1761641711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.webm?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.mp4?t=1761641711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Spin, and Customize Your Own Poop! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the &quot;UN-COINs&quot; you collect in stages to spin a Gacha for customization items for your Unko, or to unlock even more challenging bonus stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with tons of unique items to collect\u2014prove your mastery by collecting them all!</p>","developers":["\u3046\u3069\u3093\u3071"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/header.jpg?t=1761641711","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9UDONPA Published by Phoenixx Inc.<br />\r\n\u00a9Gotcha Gotcha Games Inc./YOJI OJIMA 2015","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3101010/1811400990/5ab945e7de330068055b7581e64c3651a843ba96/1761109089/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761109634","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3101010/1811400990/5ab945e7de330068055b7581e64c3651a843ba96/1761109089/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761109634","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3101010/1811400990/5ab945e7de330068055b7581e64c3651a843ba96/1761109089/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761109634","id":257037726,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037726/movie480.mp4?t=1761109634","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257037726/movie_max.mp4?t=1761109634"},"name":"July 14 PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257037726/3041f61d2a1352e8a74b8b44a5a55ee11db30d11/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761109634","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail